    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abonguni aberu a akwap a Chunem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimokini sek Elicha aberu nakolong eteyaruni ngesi lokookeng tama, “Tonyou taramakisi ka ngitunga a awi kon toloto toloma wache, kainyo eyauni Ekapolon Akuj eron a akoro min nakwap naga a ngikaru a ngikan-kaarei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.8+2KI.4.9+2KI.4.10+2KI.4.11+2KI.4.12+2KI.4.13+2KI.4.14+2KI.4.15+2KI.4.16+2KI.4.17+2KI.4.18+2KI.4.19+2KI.4.20+2KI.4.21+2KI.4.22+2KI.4.23+2KI.4.24+2KI.4.25+2KI.4.26+2KI.4.27+2KI.4.28+2KI.4.29+2KI.4.30+2KI.4.31+2KI.4.32+2KI.4.33+2KI.4.34+2KI.4.35+2KI.4.36+2KI.4.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kapol 4:8-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abu aberu ngina kiira ngakiro na alimokini Elicha, towoto ka ngitunga a awi keng toloma nakwap a Ngipilisti a ngikaru a ngikan-kaarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani adaunet a ngikaru a ngikan-kaarei, tobongo ngesi nakwap a Isirael tolot alimokin ekapolon atamar katobuakin ngesi akai ka amana keng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torukau ngesi ekapolon iruorosi ka Geasi lo arai ekasuban etich a Elicha, ingisit ebala, “Kisisakinae ayong ngakitoodikinet nakailiilok daang na asubaki Elicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eringa Geasi elimonokini ekapolon eger lo eteyarunea Elicha itwaan nikatoan, abu aberu nasek eteyarunio lokookeng tolimok ekapolon atamar asaki katobuakin akai keng ka amana. Tolimok Geasi ekapolon tama, “Ekapolon, aberu ngina ngesi naga, ka lokookeng lo eteyaruni Elicha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ingisi ekapolon aberu ngina ngakiro nguna, abu ngesi tama ikote neni. Abu ekapolon tanyarau ekapolon keng loochi tolimok tama, “Tobuak aberu naga ibore daang ni kolong arai ikeng. Ani erumor kiatak tani ngakiaset a ngalemet kadaang ana akoniunete ngamanat ngikaru lukan-kaarei daang lu awositor aberu naga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elicha ka Benadad lo arai ekapolon a Siria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot Elicha lore a Damasko ngirwa lu adeakar Benadad lo arai ekapolon a Siria. Ani elimokinio ekapolon atamar eyei Elicha neni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tolimok ngesi Asael lo arai epei a ngikapolok keng aluuchik tama, “Tolem ainakinet inaa ekadwaran sodi kingit ngesi Ekapolon Akuj tama, ‘Engalekini edeke a Benadad kori emam?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Asael kisiwok ngikaala ngitomwon-omwon ngiboro luajokak daang a Damasko, tolot nia Elicha. Ani enangi ngesi nia Elicha, tolimok tama, “Ekapolon Benadad lo erai ekasuban etich kon, ngesi kameunit ayong akingitun anikon kengalekini edeke keng kori kemam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatachu Elicha tama, “Kape tolimok ngesi atamar engalekini dir edeke keng. Nakaneni kedodik ayong Ekapolon Akuj atamar etoani ngesi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sodi tokienyik Elicha ngesi eriangakina tanang ni erumeta Asael ngileech. Abu Elicha kikalou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingit Asael tama, “Ekapolon, nyo igoror iyong?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatachak Elicha tama, “Egoro ayong kainyo ayeni ngakiro naaronok isubea iyong Ngisirael. Inomi iyong ngawasea a ngirerea kech, ka akiriar ngide kech sodi topuwono ngaberu na epotiyete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kapol 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kingit Asael ngesi tama, “Ekokini ayong ekasuban etich kon lo ekoni iingok asubi ngakiro naationok ikote nguna ai?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatachak Elicha ngesi tama, “Kedodik ayong Ekapolon Akuj atamar iliwor iyong ekapolon a Siria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobongo Asael nia Benadad. Kingit Benadad ngesi tama, “Abala Elicha ai?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatachak Asael tama, “Abala engalekini edeke kon dir.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaneni ani akolongit nache, tolem Asael eburangkit kirepak nakipi, tobunea ekapolon Benadad, taar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Asael kilunyokin nados a Benadad toliwor ekapolon a Siria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeoram lo arai ekapolon a Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaru lo a ngitomon ka ngikan lo araakar lokookeng a Aab lo anyaritae Yoram ekapolon a Isirael,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Isirael;",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "igiritae nakitabea ngache atamar Isirael; ani a Ngaeburaniae erai Isirael, tarai Yeochapat ekapolon a Yuda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abu Yeoram lo arai lokookeng a Yeochapat toliwor ekapolon a Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngirwa lu araakar ngesi ngikaru ngitomwon-uni ka ngiarei. Topolok Yeoram Yerusalem a ngikaru a ngikan-kauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arai aberu a Yeoram nakookeng a Aab. Kona araakatar ngitunga a awi a Aab ngipei ka ngesi, abu ngesi kiwap ngakiro naaronok a ngikapolok a Isirael. Tosechak ngesi Ekapolon Akuj, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kapol 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nakaneni peasaki Ekapolon Akuj akinyasun Yuda, kainyo echikakinit sek ekasuban etich keng Daudi atamar erubakinete ngalesea keng eraakasi ngikapolok jik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
